WEBVTT

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.700
What's this response?

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.930
You're not a Player or a human.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.920
You feel like nothing at all, so what are you?

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:58.970
He's Zet!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.350
If you kill him, the boss'll be angry.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:07.560
Lucky for you.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.270
It's nice that he's so passionate about his work,

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.860
but he's not very flexible.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.650
Who're you?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:15.990
What's this "boss" you're talking about?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.280
I still can't tell you that.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:23.660
But I've always been waiting for you to grow up.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.910
You're a Player?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.160
I'd rather you called me EVOL.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:31.750
It puts most of us in a sour mood when people call us Players,

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:32.670
so be careful!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:36.670
So why do you know about me, Player?

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.180
That's a secret as well.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.260
Is that girl your girlfriend?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.890
You should take good care of her.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:44.430
What?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.600
Jin!

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.860
Episode 5: Alphas

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.990
Your scheduled visit isn't until next week.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.950
We just came to see how things were going.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.120
We saw the Sweeper's light and panicked.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.120
Sweeper?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.370
The thing that tried to turn you into light.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.130
I can't believe it actually exists.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:17.250
The Sweeper's job is to obliterate Players who revert.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:21.930
It's a rule that Players have to disguise
themselves as human and blend in with society.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.510
The Sweeper erases those who go against this rule.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.640
There was one more person there.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.140
One more?

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.650
He said he was waiting for me and all
kinds of ridiculous stuff I didn't get at all.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.280
That's what I heard!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.200
Seriously?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:41.900
You look gloomy!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:47.080
Judging by your face, its not about Kouga-sama, is it?

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.160
Huh?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.200
It's a boy, isn't it!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.040
You're in love with somebody!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.920
You're like an open book!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.630
You're wrong!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.420
Today I have to stay late for PE.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.590
That's not all!

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.680
You had the look of a girl who's totally thinking about somebody!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.200
G-Good morning.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.740
It's already afternoon.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.490
I'm sorry, can I have some water?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:28.950
Water?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.200
So I can take my medicine.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.580
Thank you very much!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.090
Sometimes I get really awful headaches.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.260
And is it OK if I use your shower?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.220
I haven't bathed in two days, and I can't stand it anymore.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.220
Hey, hey!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.180
Thanks!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.730
You're a nice person.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.440
What's your name?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.940
I'm Kanzaki Jin.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:57.480
And you are?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.940
Tanaka.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.320
Tanaka what?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:03.990
Isn't just Tanaka fine?!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.990
OK, Tanaka.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.990
I'll let you stay over for just one night.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.990
Get out of here tomorrow.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.120
I'm not going!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.450
I'm still scared!

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.620
I said no, and that's that!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.610
That guy...

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.860
He noticed them, didn't he?

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:50.830
Don't peek!

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.330
As if I'd want to...

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.460
I thought you'd come.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.510
This is a top-secret project that even your father doesn't know about.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.710
Please keep it that way.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.970
Kouga-san, please look at this.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.180
We poured all of Amagi's power into making this strength suit.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.890
This is Alphas!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.160
How is it?

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.030
It's cool, right?!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.660
This is still a prototype!

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.290
If we have you try it on for real, then-

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.040
Wait.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:40.790
If you're going to claim this is Alphas, it has huge flaws.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.050
There's no cape!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.430
We thought a cape would just get in the way in terms of functionality...

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:58.230
You don't understand just how important Alphas is to me!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.270
For starters, the colour!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:01.520
Why is it black?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.860
If it's Alphas we're talking about, he's the white of justice!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.190
Justice white!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.030
And on top of that, there's no emblem on the forehead.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.990
The mark of wings representing freedom!

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.200
It's his symbol!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.710
But that would make it difficult to preserve your field of vision...

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.330
I know you guys can do it!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.210
Kouga-san...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.720
Quit adding "san" to my name, already!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:34.390
You're all older than I am, and it makes me feel like I don't belong here.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.470
Aren't we a team?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.350
Kouga-kun!

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.730
Kouga-kun, sorry about that!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.820
I'm the one who approved that design.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.110
It's fine.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.820
I believe in them.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:59.080
Thanks to everyone, I can face my justice again.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.580
I'm grateful.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.090
Please excuse me.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.090
So, shall we get started?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:11.840
Yes.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.850
I won't let you go home until you're able to swim...

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.850
That's my plan.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.280
You're Amagi Kouga-kun, right?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.790
Yes. Who might you be?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.170
Let's just say I'm a fan of yours.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.670
Isn't it rude to not introduce yourself?

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.170
I have reasons I can't.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.800
Please understand.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.050
The press conference two years ago following the arson incident,

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.560
it left a deep impression on me.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.560
Because I was looking for a hero, too.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.770
I want to help you.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:14.030
I hope that we can get along well from now on.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:19.320
So I'd like to test you to see if you're worthy of being a hero or not.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.830
Test?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.910
Just be calm, Amagi-san!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.060
There's no reason she'd pick up the phone.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.480
Your little sister's at the pool now.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.860
Here's the main problem.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.580
Let's say some murders are going to take place after this.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.450
The victims are three of your fans.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:10.460
If you come with me now, you can stop it.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:16.720
But this means it might be necessary to abandon your little sister.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.220
What're you saying?

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.890
Your sister can't swim, right?

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.720
So that means...

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:31.360
The life of one family member...

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:34.190
The lives of three strangers...

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.900
Which should justice save?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.290
You did it!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.290
Nice job!

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.670
If you just go for it, you can do it!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.550
Yes!

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.550
Huh? Onii-chan...

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.620
Here you are.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.120
We're done after this.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.120
I don't want to get involved any more.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.670
I just want to be a regular teacher.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.130
What a pity.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.880
Do the regulations of EVOL exist just to cater to humans?

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.640
Hey, geezer.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:52.100
Those failures who revert and go
around killing people are annoying us.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.610
Don't <i>you</i> do anything that's uncalled for, too!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.400
You're just the same as humans, discriminating
against your comrades and calling them failures.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:01.990
What did you say?!

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.910
Stop it.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.780
He's the one picking a fight!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.580
No single life is better than another's.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.290
EVOL wants to value life.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.250
We'd like to protect the lives we were born with,

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:19.420
living quietly without having needless fights with humans.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.930
EVOL is a small family.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.300
Jirou-san, you understand us.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.510
I think of you as a member of that family.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:33.190
So please don't cause trouble for humans.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.690
Even if those humans were members of the Amagi family?

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.650
Even if they were.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.820
I'd request it, as EVOL's boss.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:52.540
The bodies of three high school girls were discovered.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.870
The police are in the middle of investigating whether this was suicide or murder...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.710
...and are doing detailed investigations of the area.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.340
Hello?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.510
You failed the test.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.970
You made a mistake in your choice.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.970
So you're the one who killed them, aren't you?!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:15.690
I told you I want to get along with you.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.060
Do you really think I'd kill your sister after saying that?

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.360
The road to becoming a hero is steep.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.570
Let's meet again at the next test.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.460
Next time it's up to him.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.290
What would you do if you told the police?

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.750
You don't have any proof.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.760
Three people were killed!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:48.470
You have no choice but to just watch and see what moves he makes to figure out what he wants.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.930
At any rate, I'm speeding up the completion of Alphas.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.770
Is there nothing I can do?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.820
Konoha?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.030
Hello?

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.200
It looks like you never came to school today...

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.070
Sorry, something came up.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:13.040
Has something been going on lately?

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.460
You were acting weird when you
showed up at the pool yesterday, too.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.040
I was just worried because you were late coming home.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:25.380
When are you going to be done with what you're doing now?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.800
Is something going on?

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.800
I want you to come with me somewhere...

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.800
Jin-kun's definitely there.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.140
Didn't I tell you I can't meet him?!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.400
I wanna kill 'em...

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.490
Aniki, let's kill one of them.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.820
We can't! The Sweeper will come.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.870
If I don't revert, they won't find out.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.950
I understand the way you feel.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:00.120
Haitani?!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.460
Hey.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.800
EVOL's weak in thinking we should just live together with humans.

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:11.300
I'm going to make EVOL the leader of this world.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:16.180
The guy from yesterday could become our Charisma.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.730
So you can't kill him.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.060
Charisma?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:20.810
That guy?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:26.440
But I understand your feelings of wanting to kill humans.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.570
That's it, I just thought of a good idea.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.570
It's fine about Jin-kun.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.450
You can go ahead and kill him to your heart's content.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.960
It'll be fine because I'll keep the Sweeper away.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.090
Telling them not to kill and then saying they should...

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.460
Which is your real intent?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.340
It's scary when you can't see the truth.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.930
It truly is.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.970
I'm happy to see you're having lots of fun
playing around with that "ally of justice" kid.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.390
The same goes for you.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.730
Aren't you looking forward to Kanzaki Jin's growth?

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.190
There's nothing left.

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.450
You've been eating way too much since yesterday.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.490
If you're gonna be a freeloader, at least control yourself!

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.200
But my headaches get better when I eat.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.370
Guess it can't be helped.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.670
Are you going shopping?

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.130
Can I go with you?

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:26.590
Why?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.090
I don't want to be alone!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.090
You're still saying stuff like that?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.590
Wait up!

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.220
What is this place?

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.730
Are you going to have me help with your volunteer work?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.650
I came to deliver a lost item.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.860
Whose?

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.190
A friend's!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.110
It's a boy, right?!

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.870
See, that's what I thought!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.540
What're you doing?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.210
Let go of me.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.260
No, I'm scared to!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.510
What are you, a kid?

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.560
You came again?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.520
Yeah, I was wondering how you were...

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:36.780
The truth is I invited Onii-chan, too, but he said he's busy...

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.950
I told you not to come, didn't I?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.870
Go home!

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.920
That person was...?

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:59.470
It might be impossible for you to hand over his lost item.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.810
What was up with that girl?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.270
The one back there!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.320
Nothing.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.570
It didn't look like nothing!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:21.370
Why did you tell her not to come!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.700
Is it because you didn't want to be seen with me?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:26.790
Hey!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.210
Are you ignoring me again?

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.590
Go back by yourself.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.090
I keep telling you I don't want to be alone!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.680
So you're called Zet?

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.320
Please just die quietly.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:01.070
If you don't, those two high school girls will die!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.950
Is this revenge for your brother?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.960
That thing isn't my brother, or anything at all.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:15.960
I just hate people who ally themselves
with humans despite being the same as us.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.470
I don't like taking hostages, but...

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:25.510
I wanted to cripple your strength.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.470
This is bad...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.230
Use this.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:33.650
We created this to help your transformation occur at a higher rate.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.770
It's Activation Gum.

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:41.240
You can go ahead and revert.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:01.340
Tomomi!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:17.940
Nii-chan!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:24.700
We worked tirelessly and did our best to bring this closer to Alphas's image.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:25.700
How is it?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.040
Everyone, I'm so moved!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.210
This is totally Alphas!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.500
No, it's even better!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.130
Yeah, we did it!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.590
Thanks, Kouga-kun!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.210
I want to wear it as soon as possible!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.180
Hello?

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.470
Onii-chan!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.850
Save m-

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.110
I can't let you do that, Onee-chan!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.910
Torturing someone to death feels great.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.500
I can understand why everybody starts wanting to revert.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.290
Using this right away in a real battle is too dangerous!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.500
Let the police take care of Konoha!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.430
I won't allow anyone to get in the way of justice!

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.490
Alphas, go!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.830
This isn't just because she's my little sister.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:59.080
How could I just ignore that voice when it was trembling from fear?

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:02.380
Justice won't allow any evil!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:16.270
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:23.110
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:29.360
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:36.040
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:45.590
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.590 --> 00:22:51.430
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:58.270
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:09.700
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:17.330
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:28.760
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:39.280
You can't become Zet?

00:23:39.280 --> 00:23:41.270
Your family made us!

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:44.410
How about we try killing a hostage?
